    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Within domestic breeds and well-sampled wild varieties, test whether recognized sub-varieties form genetically nested descent clusters and whether phenotypic distance increases along that hierarchy. Congruent genetic nesting supports descent with modification.";
